# An outing from the first tap to the checklist the computer fetches.
wait-for 2 packs, 10 species.
tap Start an outing
wait-for Name this place
type pier
tap Save
wait-for pier
expect 0 species, 0 birds
# A bird no pack lists is logged by its name from the search.
tap Type a species
wait-for Find
type kingfisher
tap Find
wait-for No species in your packs matches
clean
shot outing-no-match
tap Log “kingfisher” by name
wait-for 1 species, 1 bird
# The species page logs into the open outing too.
tap Type a species
wait-for Find
type gull
tap Find
wait-for Western Gull
tap Western Gull
wait-for Larus occidentalis
expect Log in the open outing
tap Log in the open outing
wait-for 2 species, 2 birds
# Two taps on one row are two birds of one species.
tap American Robin
tap American Robin
wait-for 2 logged
expect 3 species, 4 birds
clean
shot outing-tally
# The tally turns back as well as forward.
tap-id outing-next
wait-for 2 of
tap-id outing-back
wait-for 1 of
tap Review sightings
wait-for American Robin ×2
expect kingfisher ×1
expect Western Gull ×1
# Clear unticks without deleting anything.
tap kingfisher ×1
tap Western Gull ×1
wait-for 2 selected
tap Clear
expect-missing selected
expect kingfisher ×1
# Several ticked rows go together and come back together.
tap kingfisher ×1
tap Western Gull ×1
wait-for 2 selected
tap-id delete-ticked
wait-for Delete 2 sightings?
clean
shot outing-confirm-two
tap-id delete-sighting
wait-for 2 sightings deleted.
expect-missing kingfisher ×1
expect American Robin ×2
tap Undo delete
wait-for kingfisher ×1
expect Western Gull ×1
clean
shot outing-sightings
# Back from the review goes to the outing it reviews.
tap Back
wait-for Review sightings
expect 3 species, 4 birds
# A finished outing stays on Today and opens again with its birds.
tap Finish outing
wait-for Start an outing
expect 3 species
tap pier ·
wait-for Review sightings
expect pier
expect 3 species, 4 birds
tap Finish outing
wait-for Start an outing
# The life list counts every bird logged on this reader.
tap Life list
wait-for 3 species on this reader.
expect AMRO · 2 birds
clean
shot outing-life
tap American Robin
wait-for Turdus migratorius
expect-missing Log in the open outing
# Back from a species goes to the list that opened it.
tap Back
wait-for 3 species on this reader.
# Export writes the checklist for kobo fieldbook export to fetch. The fetch
# refuses to overwrite a file, so a route cannot repeat it; it is checked by hand.
tap Export
wait-for 1 outing, 3 sightings.
tap Write checklist file
wait-for Checklist written. Run kobo fieldbook export on your computer to fetch it.
clean
shot outing-export-written
# Outings and sightings are still there after the app restarts.
restart
wait-for Start an outing
expect pier ·
tap Life list
wait-for 3 species on this reader.
# A write the reader refuses is said in words, and the next good one clears it.
tap Today
wait-for Start an outing
scenario storage-full
tap Start an outing
wait-for Name this place
type dunes
tap Save
wait-for Not saved. The last write failed.
clean
shot outing-not-saved
scenario normal
tap American Robin
wait-for 1 logged
expect-missing Not saved. The last write failed.
# A bird logged by name has no banding code, and its page says nothing about one.
tap Back
wait-for Open outing: dunes
tap Life list
wait-for kingfisher
expect-missing 1 birds
tap kingfisher
wait-for Species
clean
shot outing-life-by-name
expect-missing Banding code
